    </@what>
    <@starts>
      The human types <skill-ref of=aihero name="to-spec" path="skills/engineering/to-spec/SKILL.md"/> when the build needs several sessions, in the same context window as the grill.
      <skill-ref of=aihero name="ask-matt" path="skills/engineering/ask-matt/SKILL.md" line="24-25,38"/>
      <skill-ref of=aihero name="to-spec" path="skills/engineering/to-spec/SKILL.md" line="4"/>
