    </@how>
    <@bound>none stated</@bound>
    <@source>
      <cited-quote of=aihero path="skills/engineering/ask-matt/SKILL.md" line="20">**Branch: can you settle every question in conversation?** If a question needs a runnable answer (state, business logic, a UI you have to see), detour through a prototype, bridged by…</cited-quote>
    </@source>
  </@connector>

